# Proposed by the swarm (2026-10-14); the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: a day with names. Web is one window, Writing Desk a group, Scratch the Desktop, Tunes on the other display.
# Reference: A20 (docs/features/F20-named-spaces.md).
quiet
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
dock 103 beside 102 bottom

# Name what is in view: first one window, then a group.
zoom 101
name Web
expect ok
expect space Web
zoom 102
out
name  Writing   Desk
expect ok
expect space Writing Desk
expect visible 102
expect visible 103
expect hidden 101

# Go by name, by the beginning of a name, whatever the capitals; a direction is still a direction.
go web
expect fills 101
go WRI
expect space Writing Desk
expect hidden 101
back
expect fills 101
go right
expect space Writing Desk
expect hidden 101
desktop
go w
expect fail
expect camera desktop
go nowhere
expect fail
spaces
expect ok

# What cannot be a name.
name left
expect fail
name
expect fail

# A window docked at any edge of the view of a named space joins it.
go writing
open Terminal
dock 104 right
expect space Writing Desk
expect visible 102
expect visible 103
expect visible 104
expect hidden 101
expect left-of 102 104

# The space shrinks to one window and grows again, and is still the same space.
close 102
close 103
expect space Writing Desk
expect fills 104
dock 104 left
expect fail
open Editor
dock 105 bottom
expect space Writing Desk
expect above 104 105
expect hidden 101

# A name follows its window.
show-all
dock 101 beside 105 bottom
go web
expect fills 101

# The last window takes the name with it.
close 101
expect no-space Web
go web
expect fail

# The field: ⌃⌥N, type, ↩.
desktop
ask-name
expect field open
field-type up
expect fail
expect field open
field-type Scratch
expect ok
expect field closed
expect space Scratch
ask-name
field-cancel
expect field closed
ask-name
show-all
expect field closed
go scratch
ask-name
field-type
expect ok
expect no-space Scratch

# A second display: its own names, reached from anywhere.
displays 2
open Music
move 106 1700 200 600 400
dock 106 right
cursor 2000 500
zoom 106
name Tunes
cursor 700 400
show-all
go tunes
expect ok
expect space Tunes
expect camera root
displays 1
go tunes
expect fail
go writing
expect space Writing Desk
displays 2
go tunes
expect ok
